{%- comment -%}
  International transformer note (informational only — NOT an add-on or voltage selector).

  Renders a single note below Add to Cart on PRODUCT PAGES ONLY, for machines that
  are explicitly flagged as compatible with the 220V–240V external transformer box.

  Eligibility (single source of truth):
    custom.external_transformer_product  — product reference to the approved transformer.

  The electrical_requirement metafield is intentionally NOT consulted here:
    - It never independently grants eligibility.
    - It never blocks an intentionally approved product reference because its wording
      differs from a specific voltage format.

  While a canonical machine/transformer combination is still under review, the note
  links to Contact Us rather than to the transformer product.

  Usage: {% render 'intl-transformer-note', product: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if request.page_type == 'product' and product != blank -%}
  {%- assign xfmr_product = product.metafields.custom.external_transformer_product.value -%}

  {%- if xfmr_product != blank -%}
    {%- style -%}
      .intl-transformer-note {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));
      }
      @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
        .intl-transformer-note {
          font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
      }
      .intl-transformer-note a { text-decoration: underline; }
    {%- endstyle -%}
    <p class="intl-transformer-note">
      Planning to use this machine outside the U.S. or Canada?
      <a href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a> before ordering.
      International compatibility depends on the machine's voltage, frequency, plug, and power requirements.
      A transformer may not be suitable for every model.
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
